B = [
('Lenovo ThinkPad','East Asia','1990s-present','computers','In the style of Lenovo ThinkPad, serious, utilitarian corporate design. Flat slab forms with squared corners in deep matte black soft-touch finish, a fine grainy texture and razor-straight seams. A single vivid signal red appears as tiny dots, thin rules and small tabs against black and graphite grey, with minimal satin silver trim. Lettering is plain, sober sans-serif in white or black, sometimes italic, with a small red dot accent over one letter. A quieter sand-beige and kraft cardboard variation carries the name embossed into the surface in large tone-on-tone letters. Plain recycled-paper wrapping, black and red colour blocks and tidy right-angle layouts. Rugged, disciplined, no-nonsense and quietly confident.'),
('Nothing','Europe','2020s-present','electronics','In the style of Nothing, stripped-back, nerdy and quirky transparent design. Clear see-through glass and plastic shells reveal the neat inner structure of printed circuit patterns, screws and coils, with white and pale grey inner panels in tidy modular rectangles. The palette is white, black and clear, with a single tiny signal red dot used as the only accent. Soft rounded squares, flat edges and thin white line segments sit in symmetrical arrangements. Lettering is a dot-matrix typeface made of round dots, in white on black or black on white, with pixelated monochrome icons. Surfaces are frosted, glossy-clear or matte. Minimal, playful, technical and calm.'),
('Google Material Design','North America','2014-present','digital','In the style of Google Material Design, a flat but layered surface treatment where every element looks like a sheet of coloured paper lying on another, with soft diffuse shadows beneath to show height. Surfaces are flat solid colour with no bevels or gloss, in bold indigo, teal, pink, orange and purple, alongside clean white and light grey sheets with gently rounded corners. Round floating discs carry a single white pictogram and cast a soft shadow. Icons are simple geometric glyphs with even line weight. Lettering is a clean friendly geometric sans-serif in white or dark grey. Generous spacing, tidy grids, circular ripple shapes and cheerful flat colour blocks.'),
('Windows 95 era interface','North America','1995-2000','digital','In the style of Windows 95 era interface, a flat-grey bevelled surface treatment. Every panel and tile is light grey with a raised edge made from a white highlight line on the top and left and dark grey shadow lines on the bottom and right, while recessed areas are white with an inset dark edge. A flat teal green field fills the ground. Title strips are solid navy blue fading to light blue, carrying bold white sans-serif text and tiny square grey controls. Icons are chunky pixel pictograms in a sixteen colour palette, with yellow folders, dithered grey patterns and a four-colour waving flag emblem in red, green, blue and yellow. Lettering is crisp bitmap sans-serif. Blocky, beige-grey and nostalgic.'),
('Early Mac OS interface','North America','1984-1990s','digital','In the style of Early Mac OS interface, a one-bit black and white pixel surface treatment with no gradients. Shapes have thin crisp black outlines, small rounded corners and a hard offset shadow along the right and bottom edges. Grey is made only from fine dithered checkerboard and dotted patterns, and title strips are filled with thin horizontal pinstripes with a tiny square at one end. Icons are chunky hand-drawn pixel pictograms with a cheerful smiling face motif, a pointing arrow and a wristwatch shape. Lettering is a rounded, friendly pixel typeface with wide curvy letters. Later versions add soft pastel greys, lilac and teal tints with subtle bevels. Charming, crisp, hand-crafted and playful.'),
('Kinder','Europe','1970s-present','confectionery','In the style of Kinder, cheerful, wholesome, child-friendly design in clean white and bright red with accents of sky blue and warm yellow. The wordmark is large, heavy, rounded lowercase lettering in black with a red dot, set on a white field, often paired with a blue italic secondary word beneath it. A hand-drawn red heart outline and a small smiling child face give a friendly mark. Surfaces are glossy red and white, with bold stripes, milk-splash shapes in white and blue, soft egg-like rounded forms and tidy rectangular colour blocks. Foil-like metallic sheen and crisp white margins keep everything clean. Bold, innocent, bright and joyful.'),
('Pocky (Glico)','East Asia','1970s-present','confectionery','In the style of Pocky, slim, long and elegant graphic forms in narrow vertical layouts. Saturated single-colour fields in glossy red, strawberry pink, matcha green, chocolate brown and cream, each with a glossy laminated sheen. A bold white rounded wordmark sits inside a red oval or circle with a thin outline. Surfaces carry cute illustrated patterns of berries, leaves, hearts, checks and cow-like spots in soft pastels with flat colour shapes. Thin diagonal slender stick motifs are repeated as stripes, sometimes dipped in a smooth glaze edge with a white wavy splash. Lettering mixes rounded Japanese and Latin characters. Cheerful, clean, sweet, kawaii and collectable.'),
('Lea & Perrins','Europe','1840s-present','food','In the style of Lea & Perrins, dense, ornate Victorian heritage design. A rich orange-ochre label panel with a thin black border, printed with a crowded arrangement of black ornate serif, slab and engraved capitals and a small crest. Cream-white wrapping paper with fine black engraving-style text and a tea-stained patina, plus a hand-folded paper wrap with a paper seal. Deep glossy near-black glass with gold-tinted small type, and squat rectangular forms. Palette is orange, black, cream and tan, with a pale green stripe accent. Layouts are symmetrical, centred and heavily filled with tiny text. Traditional, authentic, old English and reassuring.'),
('Aesop','Oceania','2000s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Aesop, literate, apothecary-inspired restraint with quiet luxury. Rich amber-brown glass and matte brown surfaces with plain cream or off-white paper labels, set in neat black small type with long, tightly spaced lines of detail. The wordmark is a thin, classical roman serif in lowercase or small capitals, surrounded by white space. Palette is amber brown, cream, black, olive green, terracotta and muted stone, with matte black and brushed brass trim. Wrapping is plain cardboard in earthy tones with a single line of black type. Tactile, thoughtful, minimal, sensory and understated, favouring texture and text over decoration.'),
('Lush','Europe','1990s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Lush, handmade, playful and joyfully imperfect. Matte black surfaces and kraft brown paper stamped and stickered with bold hand-drawn black marker lettering, doodles, tiny scribbled icons and rough brush type. The wordmark is chunky, uneven hand-cut capitals in white on black. Vivid swirled marbled patterns in hot pink, leaf green, purple, orange and turquoise, with confetti-like blocky shapes, collage cut-outs and fresh leaf motifs. Warm cream sticky labels, string and torn-paper edges. Colour is intense and fresh against plain black and brown. Mood is bright, irreverent, fresh, abundant and hand-made.'),
]
